    E --> F[Detect ATS / JSON-LD / RSS]
    E --> G[Detect JS-heavy page]
    E --> H[Detect login / challenge signals]
    E --> I[Detect job alerts / apply links]
    F --> J[Recommend acquisition mode]
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K{User saves source?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Create Source]
    L --> M[Create SourceSchedule]
    L --> N[Create SourceHealth]
    L --> O[Persist SourceAudit]
